  "title": "Self service settings",
  "entity": "HCMv3.SystemSettings.ManageSelfServiceSettings",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>Settings for employee self-service.</p><p>Only <strong>Email Notification</strong> is read at present; the other settings have no effect.</p><p>There is one settings record per company; it cannot be deleted.</p>",
